/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Our AI study helper is a cutting-edge platform designed to revolutionize the way students learn and study. It offers personalized study materials and guidance tailored to each student's unique learning style and needs. Our study helper analyzes how students learn and what they need help with to create customized study plans, slides, and quizzes. Students can also upload and organize their own study materials, including slides, audio, video, and documents, making it a comprehensive tool for all their studying needs.)
/E (Our AI study helper is a cutting-edge platform designed to revolutionize the way students learn and study. It offers personalized study materials and guidance tailored to each student's unique learning style and needs. Our study helper analyzes how students learn and what they need help with to create customized study plans, slides, and quizzes. Students can also upload and organize their own study materials, including slides, audio, video, and documents, making it a comprehensive tool for all their studying needs.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [0]
>>
