<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Create an AI study helper that uses smart technology to provide personalized study materials and guidance to students. The helper will analyze how students learn, what they like, and what they need help with to make customized study plans, slides, and quizzes. Students can also upload and organize their own study materials like slides, audio, video, and documents. The helper can even generate summaries and mind maps using smart technology. Students can create an account and link it to their Google Drive for easy file upload. They can access their study materials offline too. With search and organization features, our AI study helper gives students a complete and efficient platform for their studying needs.)
/E (Create an AI study helper that uses smart technology to provide personalized study materials and guidance to students. The helper will analyze how students learn, what they like, and what they need help with to make customized study plans, slides, and quizzes. Students can also upload and organize their own study materials like slides, audio, video, and documents. The helper can even generate summaries and mind maps using smart technology. Students can create an account and link it to their Google Drive for easy file upload. They can access their study materials offline too. With search and organization features, our AI study helper gives students a complete and efficient platform for their studying needs.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
