470 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (What are the biggest challenges you face when it comes to studying? How do these challenges impact your learning experience? managing my time . With so many subjects and assignments to cover, it can be overwhelming to prioritize and allocate enough time to each one. Sometimes, I find it difficult to balance all my responsibilities and end up feeling stressed or rushed. In your opinion, what role does technology play in supporting effective studying? In my opinion, technology plays a vital role in supporting effective studying by providing easy access to information, offering tools for organization and productivity, and enabling interactive and engaging learning experiences. Can you describe a situation where you felt overwhelmed by the amount of information you needed to study? How did you handle it, and what improvements would you have liked to have at that time? I remember a situation where I felt overwhelmed by the amount of information I needed to study. It was during exam week when I had multiple subjects to prepare for. I had so many notes, textbooks, and online resources to go through, and it felt like I would never finish studying everything in time. To handle it, I tried to break down the information into smaller, manageable chunks and created a study schedule. I also used techniques like summarizing key points and making flashcards to help me review. I wished I had access to better study tools or apps that could have helped me organize and prioritize the information more )
/E (What are the biggest challenges you face when it comes to studying? How do these challenges impact your learning experience? managing my time . With so many subjects and assignments to cover, it can be overwhelming to prioritize and allocate enough time to each one. Sometimes, I find it difficult to balance all my responsibilities and end up feeling stressed or rushed. In your opinion, what role does technology play in supporting effective studying? In my opinion, technology plays a vital role in supporting effective studying by providing easy access to information, offering tools for organization and productivity, and enabling interactive and engaging learning experiences. Can you describe a situation where you felt overwhelmed by the amount of information you needed to study? How did you handle it, and what improvements would you have liked to have at that time? I remember a situation where I felt overwhelmed by the amount of information I needed to study. It was during exam week when I had multiple subjects to prepare for. I had so many notes, textbooks, and online resources to go through, and it felt like I would never finish studying everything in time. To handle it, I tried to break down the information into smaller, manageable chunks and created a study schedule. I also used techniques like summarizing key points and making flashcards to help me review. I wished I had access to better study tools or apps that could have helped me organize and prioritize the information more )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
