/T ( Would you rather engage in traditional studying methods involving books and papers, or do you prefer employing advanced technological techniques in today's era? Also, do you believe that utilizing technology can lead to time and effort savings? Throughout my academic journey, technology played a minimal role, as I relied predominantly on books and personal summaries, a method I cherished for my passion for traditional writing and reading. However, upon entering college, the convenience of using a tablet with all necessary books outweighed the burden of carrying physical copies. Gradually, I transitioned to utilizing various programs to streamline information organization, adapting to a more tech-oriented approach to studying.)
/E ( Would you rather engage in traditional studying methods involving books and papers, or do you prefer employing advanced technological techniques in today's era? Also, do you believe that utilizing technology can lead to time and effort savings? Throughout my academic journey, technology played a minimal role, as I relied predominantly on books and personal summaries, a method I cherished for my passion for traditional writing and reading. However, upon entering college, the convenience of using a tablet with all necessary books outweighed the burden of carrying physical copies. Gradually, I transitioned to utilizing various programs to streamline information organization, adapting to a more tech-oriented approach to studying.)
