/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The AI study helper "Gotcha" revolutionizes learning with its intuitive interface resembling social networks. It tailors study plans to individual learning styles and tracks progress. Features include personalized calendars, interactive quizzes, and a vast library of study materials. Users can collaborate, access materials offline, and receive performance analytics. Gotcha caters to students of all levels, ensuring an efficient and effective learning journey.)
/E (The AI study helper "Gotcha" revolutionizes learning with its intuitive interface resembling social networks. It tailors study plans to individual learning styles and tracks progress. Features include personalized calendars, interactive quizzes, and a vast library of study materials. Users can collaborate, access materials offline, and receive performance analytics. Gotcha caters to students of all levels, ensuring an efficient and effective learning journey.)
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
