/E (The design of "Gotcha" is user-centric, drawing inspiration from social networks for familiarity and ease of use. Clear navigation menus and prominently displayed features simplify organization and encourage engagement. The calendar provides a visual study schedule, while the quizzes screen offers interactive assessments. The design prioritizes simplicity, functionality, and engagement to enhance the learning experience.)
